//marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/friday-assorted-links-568.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=friday-assorted-links-568">Friday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Rzl7nUdEs4</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Rzl7nUdEs4</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 15:57:21 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Eric Rohmer’s life]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HF4zKNjXcAA2cyF.jpg:large"></p><p>Matthew Schmitz (@matthewschmitz) on X</p><p>Rohmer’s life was so conventional that he joked he didn’t even have one. The tendency to pathologize this says a lot about what we think a creative life is supposed to look like.
