tion/2026/04/friday-assorted-links-568.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=friday-assorted-links-568">Friday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/deanwball/status/2044899277378351220?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/deanwball/status/2044899277378351220?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 15:57:21 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[on not waking up a loser]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1396219525754937345/5L4n5L3O_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Gavin Baker (@GavinSBaker) on X</p><p>@dwarkesh_sp Much of Dwarkesh’s argument hinges on this statment which *was* accurate but will be increasingly inaccurate on a go forward basis imo: “American labs port across accelerators constantly. Anthropic’s models are run on GPUs, they’re run on Trainium, they’re run on TPUs. There</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/gavinsbaker/status/2044861680015069571?s=48">https://x.com/gavinsbaker/status/2044861680015069571?s=48</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/friday-assorted-links-568.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=friday-assorted-links-568">Friday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/gavinsbaker/status/2044861680015069571?s=48</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/gavinsbaker/status/2044861680015069571?s=48</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 15:57:21 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[How Social Media Feminised Us All ]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.freyaindia.co.uk/p/how-social-media-feminised-us-all?utm_source=%2Finbox&utm_medium=reader2">https://www.freyaindia.co.uk/p/how-social-media-feminised-us-all?utm_source=%2Finbox&utm_medium=reader2</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-4202026">Culture Links, 4/20/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.freyaindia.co.uk/