pect them to differ markedly, it’s sexual behaviour…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.stevestewartwilliams.com/p/keeping-it-casual-part-1?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.stevestewartwilliams.com/p/keeping-it-casual-part-1?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-4202026">Culture Links, 4/20/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.stevestewartwilliams.com/p/keeping-it-casual-part-1?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.stevestewartwilliams.com/p/keeping-it-casual-part-1?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 11:03:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[As society collapses we must know our enemies]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Mere anarchy is loosed upon the world…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.viewfromcullingworth.com/p/as-society-collapses-we-must-know?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.viewfromcullingworth.com/p/as-society-collapses-we-must-know?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-4202026">Culture Links, 4/20/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.viewfromcullingworth.com/p/as-society-collapses-we-must-know?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.viewfromcullingworth.com/p/as-society-collapses-we-must-know?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 11:03:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[How Social Media Feminised Us All]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Something feels painfully familiar about the way we act and communicate online lately. Things feel more petty, catty, anxious, adolescent, as though everyon